            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.25.1+2CH.25.2+2CH.25.3+2CH.25.4+2CH.25.5+2CH.25.6+2CH.25.7+2CH.25.8+2CH.25.9+2CH.25.10+2CH.25.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 25.1-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.17+2CH.36.18+2CH.36.19+2CH.36.20+2CH.36.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 36.17-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Inkilikuanishore Olaitoriani tialo iyiook, amu eitobirita Nebukadresa olaiguanani le Babilon olarrabal pee earare iyiook; eidim Olaitoriani aitaasa iyiook te risioroto oo nkiaasin enyena e nking'asia, neisho ninye metorrinyoyu aing'uaa iyiook.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Yeremia ajoki ninche: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nji intae entiaaki Sedekia, ‘Nji ejo Olaitoriani, Enkai e Israel: Ng'ura, Kashuku nanu nena masaa o larrabal naatii atua nkaik inyi naa te ninche iararere olaiguanani le Babilon niaararere Ilkaldayo oomanita intae tioriong isunta; naa kayau nanu ninche tenebo atua empolos ena anasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanu enkorrok ai oarare intae te nkaina naitoriori o enkaina nagol, te ngoro, o te mpushuna, o te ngoro kitok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kaosh nanu lelo oomanya ena anasa, oltung'ani o eng'ues, keye ninche to lmeitai kitok nepi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te siadi, Olaitoriani ojo, naisho nanu Sedekia olaiguanani le Yuda, o sinkan lenyena, o ltung'ana ootii ena anasa, ooleku lmeitai to olalem, o lameyu, naisho nanu metaarai enkaina e Nebukadresa olaiguanani le Babilon o te nkaina oo lmang'ati lenye, atua enkaina e lelo ooing'oru enkishui enye. Keosh ninyeninche te nepi o lalem, meing'urrie ninye ninche, aashu epal ninche, aashu eeta olng'ur.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore tialo kulo tung'ana tiaaki iyie: ‘Nji ejo Olaitoriani: Ng'ura, Kapik nanu dukuya iyie enkoitoi enkishui o enkoitoi e keeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilo oton tiatua ena anasa neye to lalem, o to lameyu, o to lmeitai; kake ore ilo oipang alo neisho kewan lelo kaldayo oo manita intae nepok netiu enkishui enye anaa enkishoroto olarrabal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu eitu nanu aarare ena anasa aarare te ntorroni neme te sidai, Olaitoriani ojo; keishoori ninye aapik atua enkaina olaiguanani le Babilon, naa kepejoo ninye te nkima.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkiguana e nkaji e nkitoo e Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore tialo enkaji o laiguanani le Yuda tejo, ‘Entoning ororei lo Laitoriani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na aji e Daudi! Nji ejo Olaitoriani: Tudung'o enkiguana te sipata tadekenya, niyau aitung'uaa enkaina e ilo oitorogonyisho ilo oitorongonyaki mepuku ake engoro ai anaa enkima, neyupuyup nemeetae oltung'ani oidim atara, tenkaraki nkiaasin inyi torrok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ura, kaarare nanu intae, iloomanya oyarata, iyie nadapidapoi enkisiajata, Olaitoriani ojo; intae oojo, Kaing'ae oidim atadou ataarare iyiook, aashu kaing'ae oidim atijing'a emanyisho ang?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaitame nanu intae te risioroto oo lng'anayio loo nkiaasin inyi, Olaitoriani ojo kainok nanu enkima tiatua entim enye, naa kemut ninye ina pooki namanita ninye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
